schematic.netlist:
series RLC
V1 in 0 PULSE(0 5 0 1n 1n 1 2)
R1 in a {R:spice}
L1 a out {L:spice}
C1 out 0 {C:spice}

series RLC, critically damped
V1 in 0 PULSE(0 5 0 1n 1n 1 2)
R1 in a {Rc:spice}
L1 a out {L:spice}
C1 out 0 {C:spice}

series RLC with winding resistance
V1 in 0 PULSE(0 5 0 1n 1n 1 2)
R1 in a {R1:spice}
L1 a b {L:spice}
Rw b out {Rw:spice}
C1 out 0 {C:spice}

hot plug
V1 in 0 PULSE(0 {V:spice} 0 10n 10n 1 2)
Rc in a {R:spice}
Lc a out {L:spice}
C1 out 0 {C:spice}

series RLC
V1 in 0 PULSE(0 5 0 1n 1n 1 2)
R1 in a {R:spice}
L1 a out {L:spice}
C1 out 0 {C:spice}

generator into LC
V1 in 0 PULSE(0 5 0 10n 10n 1 2)
Rs in a 50
L1 a b {L:spice}
Rw b out {Rw:spice}
C1 out 0 {C:spice}

series RLC
V1 in 0 PULSE(0 5 0 1n 1n 1 2)
R1 in a {R:spice}
L1 a out {L:spice}
C1 out 0 {C:spice}

switch node
V1 in 0 PULSE(0 12 0 10p 10p 1 2)
Ls in a {L:spice}
Rs a sw {R:spice}
Coss sw 0 {C:spice}

USB LC filter
V1 in 0 PULSE(0 5 0 1u 1u 1 2)
R1 in a {Rmin:spice}
L1 a b {L:spice}
Rw b out 0.15
C1 out 0 {C:spice}

probe ground lead
V1 in 0 PULSE(0 3.3 0 10p 10p 1 2)
Rs in a {Rs:spice}
Lg a tip {Lg:spice}
Cp tip 0 {Cp:spice}
